        ],
        Brain: {
            memories: {}
        },
        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "faelrin_torches_in"
                        },
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "no_faelrin_gift_done"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 25,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Take Morelull onto the team",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "cobblemon-initiative givemon morelull level=25"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add faelrin_gift_done"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    Cmd: "tellraw @initiator [{\"text\":\"Morelull joined you — the little lamp walks its own round now.\",\"color\":\"aqua\"}]"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "gift_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Sixteen torches. You just bought this town a quiet week, and I do not hand out the word quiet lightly. So — I want you to meet somebody. Little glowing fellow started following the round three months back. Morelull. Lights its own caps, minds its own business, scared off a drowned once by existing at it."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The round has torches now. It does not need two lamps that walk. And a thing that grew up guarding a boardwalk should see what the dark looks like past the third willow. Take it. It likes shoulders and it dims itself when you sleep, which is more courtesy than I get from most people."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Faelrin — a lamp that walks",
                    Label: "gifted"
                },
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "faelrin_gift_done"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 24,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Goodbye",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "goodbye_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "How is the lamp? Do not answer — I can see it from here, glowing like it invented the concept. Best partner I ever had on the round. Never once complained about my tallying."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Last night: two creepers, one skeleton, zero incidents under the lamps. Your torches are holding. If the marsh takes a night off, that is the closest it comes to a thank-you."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Faelrin — off duty",
                    Label: "done"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Hand over 16 torches for the lamp round",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "cobblemon-initiative turnin minecraft:torch 16 faelrin_torches_in"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "torches_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Goodbye",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "goodbye_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Three creepers, a drowned that climbed up under the west stilts, and something with too many eyes that the lamplight scared off before I could count them. That was one night. In a town. You start to understand why we are all a little strange here."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "I walk the round with old Lysira when my nerve holds. Somebody has to. A town that lets its dark keep teeth is a town that has to earn every morning."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You sleeping here? Bar the shutters. Do not investigate the noise. The noise is never worth investigating."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The lamp round eats torches faster than the town dips them. Sixteen would see me through the week — and a man walking the dark with a full satchel walks it a good deal braver."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Faelrin Nightreed",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
        },
